      en: ["Peak Timbers manages vast forest estates in the mountainous north of Eswatini", "The sawmill produces tens of thousands of cubic metres of timber annually", "The primary market for its products is the South African construction industry", "The facility utilizes modern laser-cutting technology for maximum recovery", "The company operates its own nurseries to support reforestation efforts", "Dedicated fire-fighting brigades protect the valuable timber assets"],
